/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Root8[2]- <-> Tenth[38]+ (record
r8f:R82-, e = -1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wR8fR82nTHX` and `wR8fR82nTGX` (divided by `2 ^ 12`
and `2 ^ 27`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

